verlook.\n  [1] (46) the exact budget needed for each work package.\n  [2] (47) the full list of tasks inside the project plan.\n  [3] (46) the delays caused by the documentation review.\n\n### ch4-q10 lens=[68,57,57,49] ca=0\nQ: Which of the following best describes the risk register and its role?\n  [0] (68) CORRECT* a document that records the risks identified throughout the project.\n  [1] (57) a tool that translates every threat into a dollar amount.\n  [2] (57) a chart that compares the current project with past ones.\n  [3] (49) a list that assigns owners to every work package.\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"& \"C:\\xampp\\php\\php.exe\" \"C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\ias2build\\extract7.php\"","time":{"start":1789885893386,"end":1789885893786}},"id":"prt_0bd8348a2001mqlGLDnyH2quus","sessionID":"ses_f428ff92affeQ6wiY0s4pQPZG0","messageID":"msg_0bd83437900108xslmwLY3y64L"}}
