{"type":"text","timestamp":1789885956310,"sessionID":"ses_f428ff92affeQ6wiY0s4pQPZG0","part":{"id":"prt_0bd84253d001U8P6pYRjhm910i","messageID":"msg_0bd84207c001qVwJ2UKDJSanZs","sessionID":"ses_f428ff92affeQ6wiY0s4pQPZG0","type":"text","text":"The question bank was written to `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\rkq7bk65si88kk\\questions.json`.\n\nValidated delivery summary:\n- **6 chapters** (L3–L8), **180 questions** (30 each), exactly 4 choices each, one correct answer, explanations grounded in the source.\n- **Balanced answers**: A/B/C/D at exactly 45/45/45/45 globally; max consecutive same-letter run = 2; no sequences like ABCD repeats.\n- **Anti-guessing audited**: after a parity-fix pass, the correct answer is the unique-longest option at the random baseline (~25%, all gaps ≤ 10 chars); no keyword/technicality/grammar clues detected.\n- **72 encyclopedia entries**, all schema-compliant; valid JSON; temp build files removed.\n\nThe worker (`worker.php`) will now validate, normalize, and mark this exam `done` in the SQLite DB so `exam.php?id=rkq7bk65si88kk` serves it.","time":{"start":1789885949245,"end":1789885956285}}}
